sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor F as Family member
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API
  participant S as Object storage
  participant X as Extraction pipeline
  participant M as Muse Spark 1.3
  participant E as Safety engine
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  F->>W: Photo of a new prescription
  W->>A: POST /documents
  A->>S: Store file, SHA-256
  A->>D: documents row (uploaded)
  A-->>W: 202 document id
  A->>X: Start extraction
  X->>M: Image + JSON schema + instructions
  M-->>X: Items with page, line, quote
  X->>X: Validate schema, check every quote exists in the page text
  X->>D: extractions row (raw output, validated)
  X->>E: Compare with current care plan
  E->>D: plan_changes (new, changed, stopped)
  E->>D: Allergy check: find_allergy_conflicts per new medicine
  alt Direct, family or unresolved match
    E->>D: allergy_conflicts (open) + urgent outbox rows
    E->>M: Word the flag and the question for the doctor
    M-->>E: Plain-language text
    E->>E: Output guard (source, no "safe", no dosing advice)
  end
  X->>D: Apply document-derived items (visit items wait for confirmation)
  D-->>W: Notify family (in-app, WhatsApp if enabled)
  W-->>F: What changed + red allergy banner, source on every line
